<properties>
<property name="family">sensor</property>
</properties>
<description>Papan pH Gravity DFRobot SEN0161-V2 (analog). Label papan: - + A. Supply 3.3-5.5V, output 0-3.0V -&gt; aman langsung ke ADC GPIO33 (tanpa divider).</description>
